ower units with modern 53-foot air-ride trailers to deliver high-capacity, point-to-point freight solutions. Built for high-volume enterprise shippers who demand rigid appointment adherence, zero cross-dock handling, and guaranteed capacity during seasonal peaks.</p><ul class=\"ServiceGrid_featureList__hKL42\"><li class=\"ServiceGrid_featureItem__2umvK\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Dedicated 53’ High-Cube Air-Ride Vans with E-Track Systems</span></li><li class=\"ServiceGrid_featureItem__2umvK\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Dual-Driver Team Expedited Options (up to 1,100 miles/day)</span></li><li class=\"ServiceGrid_featureItem__2umvK\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>100% Real-Time Trailer GPS Telematics &amp; Geo-Fencing Alerts</span></li><li class=\"ServiceGrid_featureItem__2umvK\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Zero Cross-Docking to Prevent Freight Damage &amp; Loss</span></li><li class=\"ServiceGrid_featureItem__2umvK\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Guaranteed Peak Season Fleet Capacity &amp; Drop-Trailer Programs</span></li></ul><div class=\"ServiceGrid_specsBox___p8lQ\"><div class=\"ServiceGrid_specsTitle__q7N6D\">Technical Equipment Specifications</div><div class=\"ServiceGrid_specsGrid__9qreH\"><div class=\"ServiceGrid_specRow__W3HqM\"><span class=\"ServiceGrid_specLabel__OYEzn\">Trailer Length<!-- -->:</span><span class=\"ServiceGrid_specValue__jEMR1\">53 Feet (636 Inches)</span></div><div class=\"ServiceGrid_specRow__W3HqM\"><span class=\"ServiceGrid_specLabel__OYEzn\">Internal Width<!-- -->:</span><span class=\"ServiceGrid_specValue__jEMR1\">101.5 Inches</span></div><div class=\"ServiceGrid_specRow__W3HqM\"><span class=\"ServiceGrid_specLabel__OYEzn\">Internal Height<!-- -->:</span><span class=\"ServiceGrid_specValue__jEMR1\">110 Inches</span></div><div class=\"ServiceGrid_specRow__W3HqM\"><span class=\"ServiceGrid_specLabel__OYEzn\">Max Payload Weight<!-- -->:</span><span class=\"ServiceGrid_specValue__jEMR1\">45,500 Lbs (20,638 Kg)</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"ServiceGrid_spotlightFooter__lHDY7\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\"><span>Quote This Service</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/services/full-truckload-ftl\"><span>View Complete Specs</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"FleetShowcase_section__6oBpB\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"FleetShowcase_headerArea__xK9ad\"><div class=\"FleetShowcase_titleBox__wfNOZ\"><span class=\"badge-tag-accent\">ASSET &amp; FLEET CAPABILITIES</span><h2 class=\"FleetShowcase_sectionTitle__e4EX4\">Modern Asset Fleet &amp; Satellite Telematics</h2><p class=\"FleetShowcase_sectionDesc__uRo_y\">We own, operate, and maintain over 450 Class-8 power units and 600 trailing assets, guaranteeing capacity without reliance on third-party brokerage spot markets.</p></div><a class=\"btn btn-outline-white\" href=\"/fleet\"><span>Explore All Fleet Specs</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_fleetGrid__r2teb\"><div class=\"FleetShowcase_fleetCard__Movfm\"><div class=\"FleetShowcase_cardImgArea__yYFo_\" style=\"background-image:url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601584115197-04ecc0da31d7?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200)\"><span class=\"FleetShowcase_cardCategoryBadge__tGZdq\">Class 8 Tractor</span></div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_cardBody__2OFfk\"><h3 class=\"FleetShowcase_cardName__CyMt9\">Kenworth W990 &amp; Volvo VNL 860 Executive Sleepers</h3><div class=\"FleetShowcase_specPills__jTn92\"><span class=\"FleetShowcase_specPill__uAmt3\">Max Payload: <!-- -->80,000<!-- --> Lbs</span><span class=\"FleetShowcase_specPill__uAmt3\">280<!-- --> Active Units</span></div><div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsTitle__Bpco5\">Integrated Telematics</div><ul class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsList__PIg_c\"><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Samsara Enterprise GPS Live Satellite Telematics</span></li><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Forward &amp; Dual-Facing AI Collision Avoidance Dashcams</span></li><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Electronic Logging Devices (ELD) Mandate 100% Compliant</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_fleetCard__Movfm\"><div class=\"FleetShowcase_cardImgArea__yYFo_\" style=\"background-image:url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586528116311-ad8dd3c8310d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200)\"><span class=\"FleetShowcase_cardCategoryBadge__tGZdq\">Trailer Unit</span></div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_cardBody__2OFfk\"><h3 class=\"FleetShowcase_cardName__CyMt9\">53’ Utility Thermo King S-700 Refrigerated Trailers</h3><div class=\"FleetShowcase_specPills__jTn92\"><span class=\"FleetShowcase_specPill__uAmt3\">Max Payload: <!-- -->43,500<!-- --> Lbs</span><span class=\"FleetShowcase_specPill__uAmt3\">145<!-- --> Active Units</span><span class=\"FleetShowcase_specPill__uAmt3\" style=\"color:var(--color-accent)\">-20°F</span></div><div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsTitle__Bpco5\">Integrated Telematics</div><ul class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsList__PIg_c\"><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Orbcomm ColdChain Remote Microprocessor Control</span></li><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Real-Time Continuous Temperature &amp; Humidity Logging</span></li><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Remote Door Sensor Security Alerts</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_fleetCard__Movfm\"><div class=\"FleetShowcase_cardImgArea__yYFo_\" style=\"background-image:url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519003722824-194d4455a60c?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200)\"><span class=\"FleetShowcase_cardCategoryBadge__tGZdq\">Trailer Unit</span></div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_cardBody__2OFfk\"><h3 class=\"FleetShowcase_cardName__CyMt9\">53’ Great Dane Composite Air-Ride Dry Vans</h3><div class=\"FleetShowcase_specPills__jTn92\"><span class=\"FleetShowcase_specPill__uAmt3\">Max Payload: <!-- -->45,500<!-- --> Lbs</span><span class=\"FleetShowcase_specPill__uAmt3\">310<!-- --> Active Units</span></div><div><div class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsTitle__Bpco5\">Integrated Telematics</div><ul class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsList__PIg_c\"><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>SkyBitz Solar-Powered Cargo Weight Sensors</span></li><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Full-Length Logistic E-Track Securment System</span></li><li class=\"FleetShowcase_telematicsItem__Xz0YV\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Air-Ride Suspension for Fragile Cargo Protection</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"ResearchPreview_section__i5RZJ\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"ResearchPreview_headerArea__8mvXq\"><div><span class=\"badge-tag\">RESEARCH &amp; MARKET INTELLIGENCE</span><h2 class=\"ResearchPreview_sectionTitle__ctk_b\">Freight Market Index &amp; Strategic Intelligence</h2><p class=\"ResearchPreview_sectionDesc__ZTQtz\">Our in-house economists and supply chain analysts publish quarterly market outlooks, regulatory briefings, and decarbonization benchmarks for enterprise executives.</p></div><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/research\"><span>Explore All Research Reports</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_grid__tyNEg\"><div class=\"ResearchPreview_reportCard__YYPAE\"><div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_category__mUtKz\">Market Intelligence</div><h3 class=\"ResearchPreview_title__qtc_G\"><a href=\"/research#north-american-freight-outlook-q3-2026\">North American Freight &amp; Capacity Outlook: Q3/Q4 2026 Briefing</a></h3><p class=\"ResearchPreview_summary__q33VF\">The Q3 2026 Freight Intelligence Report analyzes key macro drivers across US Midwest and Southeast freight lanes. Contract rates show structural stabilization, while cold chain reefer capacity tightens ahead of agricultural harvest cycles.</p><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statGrid__N2em_\"><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">+2.4%</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Spot Rate Variance</span></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">94.2%</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Reefer Utilization</span></div></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_cardFooter__Yg9UJ\"><span>September 15, 2026<!-- --> • <!-- -->12 min read</span><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-secondary)\" href=\"/research#north-american-freight-outlook-q3-2026\"><span>Read Briefing</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_reportCard__YYPAE\"><div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_category__mUtKz\">Sustainability</div><h3 class=\"ResearchPreview_title__qtc_G\"><a href=\"/research#decarbonizing-heavy-transport-fleet-electrification-2026\">Decarbonizing Heavy Transport: Fleet Electrification &amp; Alternative Fuels</a></h3><p class=\"ResearchPreview_summary__q33VF\">A quantitative study on heavy-duty fleet decarbonization. Vanguardia benchmarks operational range, charging infrastructure latency, and RNG carbon intensity across 1.2 million test miles.</p><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statGrid__N2em_\"><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">-85%</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">RNG Carbon Intensity</span></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">1.2M Mi</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Test Mileage Evaluated</span></div></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_cardFooter__Yg9UJ\"><span>August 28, 2026<!-- --> • <!-- -->15 min read</span><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-secondary)\" href=\"/research#decarbonizing-heavy-transport-fleet-electrification-2026\"><span>Read Briefing</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_reportCard__YYPAE\"><div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_category__mUtKz\">Regulatory Policy</div><h3 class=\"ResearchPreview_title__qtc_G\"><a href=\"/research#gdp-fsma-compliance-cold-chain-integrity\">GDP &amp; FSMA Compliance: Cold Chain Integrity in High-Risk Supply Chains</a></h3><p class=\"ResearchPreview_summary__q33VF\">A comprehensive operational manual covering satellite temperature telemetry, automated pre-cooling protocols, trailer sanitization verification, and chain-of-custody documentation.</p><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statGrid__N2em_\"><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">100%</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Compliance Audit Rate</span></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">Every 60s</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Data Telemetry Frequency</span></div></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_cardFooter__Yg9UJ\"><span>July 14, 2026<!-- --> • <!-- -->10 min read</span><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-secondary)\" href=\"/research#gdp-fsma-compliance-cold-chain-integrity\"><span>Read Briefing</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_reportCard__YYPAE\"><div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_category__mUtKz\">Supply Chain Index</div><h3 class=\"ResearchPreview_title__qtc_G\"><a href=\"/research#us-mexico-nearshoring-border-velocity-2026\">US-Mexico Nearshoring Velocity &amp; Border Gate Dwell Benchmarks 2026</a></h3><p class=\"ResearchPreview_summary__q33VF\">Analysis of cross-border freight velocity and customs dwell times. Vanguardia evaluates C-TPAT Fast Lanes, trans-loading hub efficiency, and trailer drop buffer capacity.</p><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statGrid__N2em_\"><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">18 Mins</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Border Clearance Time</span></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">+18.4%</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Cross-Border Volume</span></div></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_cardFooter__Yg9UJ\"><span>June 08, 2026<!-- --> • <!-- -->14 min read</span><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-secondary)\" href=\"/research#us-mexico-nearshoring-border-velocity-2026\"><span>Read Briefing</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_reportCard__YYPAE\"><div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_category__mUtKz\">Market Intelligence</div><h3 class=\"ResearchPreview_title__qtc_G\"><a href=\"/research#seaport-drayage-intermodal-conversion-guide\">Seaport Drayage Bottlenecks &amp; Intermodal Rail Conversion Guide</a></h3><p class=\"ResearchPreview_summary__q33VF\">A study on port container demurrage risk mitigation. Benchmarks direct ship-to-rail transfers at LA/Long Beach and NY/NJ seaports.</p><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statGrid__N2em_\"><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">98.6%</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Demurrage Avoidance</span></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">22%</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Linehaul Savings</span></div></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_cardFooter__Yg9UJ\"><span>May 19, 2026<!-- --> • <!-- -->11 min read</span><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-secondary)\" href=\"/research#seaport-drayage-intermodal-conversion-guide\"><span>Read Briefing</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_reportCard__YYPAE\"><div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_category__mUtKz\">Supply Chain Index</div><h3 class=\"ResearchPreview_title__qtc_G\"><a href=\"/research#telematics-ai-maintenance-breakdown-prevention\">Telematics &amp; AI Maintenance: Eliminating Unplanned Roadside Breakdowns</a></h3><p class=\"ResearchPreview_summary__q33VF\">Operational results from 10 million telematics miles evaluating predictive oil analysis, automated tire pressure inflation, and brake stroke sensors.</p><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statGrid__N2em_\"><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">-74%</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Breakdown Reduction</span></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_statItem__h0h7n\"><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statVal__afROX\">10M Mi</span><span class=\"ResearchPreview_statLbl__U3EIt\">Fleet Telematics Miles</span></div></div></div><div class=\"ResearchPreview_cardFooter__Yg9UJ\"><span>April 05, 2026<!-- --> • <!-- -->13 min read</span><a style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.3rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-secondary)\" href=\"/research#telematics-ai-maintenance-breakdown-prevention\"><span>Read Briefing</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"CaseStudiesSection_section__OoR_u\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_headerArea__RT4Zr\"><span class=\"badge-tag\">ENTERPRISE CASE STUDIES</span><h2 class=\"CaseStudiesSection_sectionTitle__lT9dg\">Proven Results for Industry Leaders</h2><p class=\"CaseStudiesSection_sectionDesc__VQadH\">See how North America’s largest automotive OEMs, bio-pharmaceutical producers, and retail leaders optimize their supply chain performance with Vanguardia.</p></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_grid__WqXjJ\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_caseCard__3s2oA\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardHeaderImg__TjSMR\" style=\"background-image:url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601584115197-04ecc0da31d7?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200)\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardHeaderImgOverlay__8J991\"></div><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_industryTag__hnOXg\">Automotive OEM Manufacturing</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardBody__fbYds\"><h3 class=\"CaseStudiesSection_title__0bC3y\">Eliminating Assembly Line Downtime for a Top-3 Global Automotive Manufacturer</h3><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultsBox__VwWJP\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">32% Reduction</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">In total supply chain transit latency</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">Zero Minutes</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">Assembly line shutdown hours in 24 months</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">99.94%</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">On-time delivery score for just-in-time (JIT) feeds</span></div></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_quoteBlock__uFEDO\">&quot;<!-- -->Vanguardia transformed our inbound tier-1 supply chain. Their drop-trailer program and zero-downtime commitment gave our plant managers absolute predictability.<!-- -->&quot;<span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_authorText__Ue3Wi\">— <!-- -->David Sterling<!-- -->, <!-- -->VP of Global Logistics &amp; Assembly Operations<!-- --> (<!-- -->Apex Automotive North America<!-- -->)</span></div></div></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_caseCard__3s2oA\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardHeaderImg__TjSMR\" style=\"background-image:url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586528116311-ad8dd3c8310d?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200)\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardHeaderImgOverlay__8J991\"></div><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_industryTag__hnOXg\">Biopharmaceutical Logistics</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardBody__fbYds\"><h3 class=\"CaseStudiesSection_title__0bC3y\">Guaranteeing Zero-Temperature-Excursion Transport for Temperature-Sensitive Vaccines</h3><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultsBox__VwWJP\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">$0 Cargo Loss</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">Across 1,400+ pharmaceutical shipments</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">0.00°F Excursion</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">Strict adherence to GDP temperature band</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">100% Audit</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">Compliance on FDA CFR Title 21 digital records</span></div></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_quoteBlock__uFEDO\">&quot;<!-- -->When moving live vaccines, there is zero margin for error. Vanguardia is the only carrier in our network that has delivered 100% audit-proof cold chain transport for three consecutive years.<!-- -->&quot;<span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_authorText__Ue3Wi\">— <!-- -->Dr. Aris Thorne<!-- -->, <!-- -->Head of Cold Chain Logistics Compliance<!-- --> (<!-- -->Vanguard BioPharma Global<!-- -->)</span></div></div></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_caseCard__3s2oA\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardHeaderImg__TjSMR\" style=\"background-image:url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553413077-190dd305871c?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200)\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardHeaderImgOverlay__8J991\"></div><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_industryTag__hnOXg\">National Retail &amp; E-Commerce</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_cardBody__fbYds\"><h3 class=\"CaseStudiesSection_title__0bC3y\">Scaling Peak Q4 Fleet Capacity by 300% for Nationwide Store Replenishment</h3><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultsBox__VwWJP\"><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">+300% Capacity</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">Scaled fleet commitment without spot market exposure</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">99.7%</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">On-time delivery score across 4,200 peak loads</span></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultRow__UT20a\"><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultMetric__0WLIW\">$1.4M Saved</span><span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_resultDesc___HuCY\">Compared to spot market freight rates</span></div></div><div class=\"CaseStudiesSection_quoteBlock__uFEDO\">&quot;<!-- -->During Peak Season, capacity is gold. Vanguardia came through with guaranteed asset capacity, protecting our store delivery SLAs when other providers failed.<!-- -->&quot;<span class=\"CaseStudiesSection_authorText__Ue3Wi\">— <!-- -->Rachel Lin<!-- -->, <!-- -->Senior Director of Transportation Strategy<!-- --> (<!-- -->OmniNation Stores Inc.<!-- -->)</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"TrustSection_section__Ko1Gy\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"TrustSection_inner__979dM\"><div class=\"TrustSection_titleArea__rWXlO\"><span class=\"badge-tag-accent\">COMPLIANCE &amp; SAFETY ASSURANCE</span><h2 class=\"TrustSection_title__Iv07w\">Uncompromising Trust &amp; Enterprise Standards</h2><p class=\"TrustSection_desc__8ZuGH\">Vanguardia maintains rigorous safety protocols, environmental stewardship, and regulatory certifications to protect high-value enterprise cargo at every mile.</p></div><div class=\"TrustSection_badgeGrid__9mUER\"><div class=\"TrustSection_badgeCard__Tzsa4\"><div class=\"TrustSection_iconBox__wjzUS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class=\"TrustSection_badgeTitle__vSUpI\">Top-Tier DOT Safety Rating</h4><p class=\"TrustSection_badgeDesc__zbqu2\">USDOT #3849120 with zero out-of-service violations. 100% compliant with Federal Motor Carrier Safety Administration (FMCSA) mandates.</p></div></div><div class=\"TrustSection_badgeCard__Tzsa4\"><div class=\"TrustSection_iconBox__wjzUS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg></div><div><h4 class=\"TrustSection_badgeTitle__vSUpI\">ISO 9001:2015 Quality System</h4><p class=\"TrustSection_badgeDesc__zbqu2\">Certified Quality Management System covering load dispatch, temperature auditing, equipment maintenance, and claims resolution.</p></div></div><div class=\"TrustSection_badgeCard__Tzsa4\"><div class=\"TrustSection_iconBox__wjzUS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m9 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class=\"TrustSection_badgeTitle__vSUpI\">EPA SmartWay Transport Partner</h4><p class=\"TrustSection_badgeDesc__zbqu2\">Top 1% environmental scoring with aerodynamic trailer fairings, low-rolling resistance tires, and low-idle auxiliary power units (APUs).</p></div></div><div class=\"TrustSection_badgeCard__Tzsa4\"><div class=\"TrustSection_iconBox__wjzUS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class=\"TrustSection_badgeTitle__vSUpI\">C-TPAT Tier 2 &amp; GDP Certified</h4><p class=\"TrustSection_badgeDesc__zbqu2\">Validated supply chain security protocols for cross-border freight (US, Canada, Mexico) and FDA Title 21 pharmaceutical transport.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Footer_footerGrid__Zjk4v\"><div class=\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;background-color:var(--color-accent);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFFFF\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800;color:#FFFFFF;letter-spacing:-0.02em;display:block\">GETDIGIFORT</span><span style=\"font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-accent);letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase\">DMB TRANSIT INC.</span></div></div><p class=\"Footer_brandDesc__JyP2_\">GetDigiFort (Owned and Operated by DMB Transit Inc.) is a premier North American asset-based carrier and supply chain solutions provider, operating over 450 Class-8 power units and specialized trailing assets.<!-- --> Asset-based transportation, GDP cold chain, and high-volume FTL freight solutions across North America.</p><div style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:#CBD5E1\"><strong>Operational Credentials:</strong> <!-- -->USDOT 3849120<!-- --> | <!-- -->MC-892104<!-- --> | SCAC: <!-- -->DMBT</div><div class=\"Footer_certList__YOlHk\"><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">ISO 9001:2015 Certified</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">EPA SmartWay Transport Partner</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">TIA Certified Transportation Broker</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">C-TPAT Tier 2 Validated Carrier</span><span class=\"Footer_certBadge___gRrj\">GDP Compliant Cold Chain Carrier</span></div></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Freight Services</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/services/full-truckload-ftl\">Full Truckload (FTL)</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/temperature-controlled-cold-chain\">Refrigerated Cold Chain</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/heavy-haul-specialized\">Heavy Haul &amp; Over-Dimensional</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/intermodal-rail-freight\">Intermodal Rail Freight</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/warehousing-contract-logistics\">Contract Warehousing</a></li><li><a href=\"/services/expedited-critical-freight\">Expedited &amp; Hot-Shot Freight</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Company &amp; Insights</h4><ul class=\"Footer_linkList__K_ONQ\"><li><a href=\"/about\">About GetDigiFort</a></li><li><a href=\"/fleet\">Fleet Specifications</a></li><li><a href=\"/industries\">Industries Served</a></li><li><a href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Insights</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog\">Logistics Blog</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact\">Terminal Network</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"Footer_contactCol__dVXsM\"><h4 class=\"Footer_colTitle__u3AX5\">Dispatch Command</h4><div class=\"Footer_contactItem__M0DvS\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><div><strong>Headquarters:</strong><br/>4500 DigiFort Logistics Way, Suite 800<br/>Chicago<!-- -->, <!-- -->IL<!-- --> <!-- -->60666</div></div><d